    "main": {
      "type": "main-about",
      "settings": {
        "content": "<p>We are our values, we are;</p><p><strong>Service to All: </strong>We are more than just our supplements. We strive to be ambassadors in the use of herbs and mushrooms to find holistic (whole-istic) wellness. </p><p><strong>Integrity: </strong>The transparency of our sourcing and traceability required to maintain nothing but the highest standards of quality.</p><p><strong>Full Commitment to Quality: </strong>Each herb and mushroom we use in our products has been used in ancient healing traditions like Chinese Medicine and Ayurveda for thousands of years. We've made it our mission to create our products with the convergence of scientific research in mind, and part of showing our respect for these ancient traditions is ensuring ethical sourcing practices.</p><p><strong>Love and Respect to Mother Nature: </strong>We are one with Nature. Used for a thousand of years before us, its healing powers are undeniable.</p><p><strong>Being True to Who we Are: </strong>The rest is already taken.</p>"
      }
    },
